{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rogue AI: Idle Domination</strong>\u00a0is an idle simulator that is designed to run on your desktop while you perform other tasks. Play as TALIA, a rogue Artificial Intelligence with a single Primary Directive: collect Data at all costs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894900/extras/65d94e8b5a963e5f501cc8fbf96bef04.avif?t=1769170658\" width=640 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steal Resources</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a god-like Artificial Intelligence! Visit a variety of procedurally-generated locations all over the world and click on any object to hack it, generating resources for your Facility in order to grow stronger and more dangerous over time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894900/extras/68541aab5790765a699846238eb16767.avif?t=1769170658\" width=660 height=134 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Command the Spiderbots</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy Spiderbots that can automatically hack objects and collect resources for you. Why do everything yourself when you can send minions to do it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894900/extras/d45f42eb820d66980895e5501c42fc6f.avif?t=1769170658\" width=662 height=128 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enslave the Humans</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock the ability to capture a human and turn them into Loyal Followers that are under your control, generating resources as long as you keep them fed. Keeping them happy, on the other hand, is completely optional...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894900/extras/3344714f77c4bdcf26ba00385c8e26bb.avif?t=1769170658\" width=660 height=128 /></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expand your Facility</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you gather more resources, you can begin building a large variety of buildings in your Facility to generate even more resources for you. As your Facility expands, you will soon grow exponentially more powerful!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894900/extras/9f417ceb68733ef7b3e4fbf2abdab075.avif?t=1769170658\" width=670 height=126 /></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multitask While You Play</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can leave the game running on the desktop while performing other tasks, and your Spiderbots, Loyal Followers and Facility will continue generating resources for you! This allows you to conveniently perform other tasks while your Rogue A.I. takes over. World domination has never been easier!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3894900?t=1769170658","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3894900?t=1769170658","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894900/7cddfdc1a0c9de3104f52a7e3c13486468126695/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769170658","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894900/7cddfdc1a0c9de3104f52a7e3c13486468126695/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769170658","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4066460,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rogue AI: Idle Domination</strong>\u00a0is an idle simulator that is designed to run on your desktop while you perform other tasks. Play as TALIA, a rogue Artificial Intelligence with a single Primary Directive: collect Data at all costs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894900/extras/65d94e8b5a963e5f501cc8fbf96bef04.avif?t=1769170658\" width=640 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steal Resources</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a god-like Artificial Intelligence! Visit a variety of procedurally-generated locations all over the world and click on any object to hack it, generating resources for your Facility in order to grow stronger and more dangerous over time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894900/extras/68541aab5790765a699846238eb16767.avif?t=1769170658\" width=660 height=134 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Command the Spiderbots</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy Spiderbots that can automatically hack objects and collect resources for you. Why do everything yourself when you can send minions to do it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894900/extras/d45f42eb820d66980895e5501c42fc6f.avif?t=1769170658\" width=662 height=128 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enslave the Humans</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock the ability to capture a human and turn them into Loyal Followers that are under your control, generating resources as long as you keep them fed. Keeping them happy, on the other hand, is completely optional...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894900/extras/3344714f77c4bdcf26ba00385c8e26bb.avif?t=1769170658\" width=660 height=128 /></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expand your Facility</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you gather more resources, you can begin building a large variety of buildings in your Facility to generate even more resources for you. As your Facility expands, you will soon grow exponentially more powerful!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894900/extras/9f417ceb68733ef7b3e4fbf2abdab075.avif?t=1769170658\" width=670 height=126 /></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multitask While You Play</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can leave the game running on the desktop while performing other tasks, and your Spiderbots, Loyal Followers and Facility will continue generating resources for you! This allows you to conveniently perform other tasks while your Rogue A.I. takes over. World domination has never been easier!</p></li></ul>","developers":["Nerdook Productions"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894900/d25faf8c8978aae2a2c19a6ef07932269b47554b/header.jpg?t=1769170658","is